      "text": "MAC VALUES:\n  Sevoflurane:  MAC = 2.05%;  blood:gas λ = 0.65 (low → fast on/off)\n  Desflurane:   MAC = 6.0%;   blood:gas λ = 0.42 (lowest → fastest, but airway irritant)\n  Isoflurane:   MAC = 1.17%;  blood:gas λ = 1.4  (slower; cheapest; still used)\n  Halothane:    MAC = 0.77%;  blood:gas λ = 2.5  (historic; higher solubility → slow)\n  Nitrous oxide: MAC = 104%;  blood:gas λ = 0.47 (cannot achieve MAC in air alone!)"
    },
    {
