      },
      "text": "BLOOD:GAS COEFFICIENT:\n  Low coefficient → less drug dissolves in blood → faster equilibrium → fast induction/recovery\n  Desflurane fastest emergence (useful for outpatient/ambulatory surgery)\n  Sevoflurane: sweet smell → good for inhalational induction in children; most used worldwide"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-ANESTHESIA-SURGERY.md#018",
